# {{ app_name }}

Interactive AI Safety Dashboard built with Streamlit and {{ llm_provider.title() }} Integration

## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 2. Environment Setup

Create a `.env` file:

```bash
# {{ llm_provider.title() }} Configuration
{% if llm_provider == 'openai' %}
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
{% elif llm_provider == 'ollama' %}
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
{% elif llm_provider == '' %}
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your__api_key_here
{% endif %}

# Optional: Custom model cache directory
AI_SAFETY_CACHE_DIR=/path/to/model/cache
```

### 3. Run the Application

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

The dashboard will open in your browser at: http://localhost:8501

